{"id": "2024-08-19--meta--facebook--privacy-policy--f479d79", "date": "2024-08-19T00:30:35Z", "platform": "meta", "platform_name": "Meta", "service": "Facebook", "doc_id": "meta--facebook--privacy-policy", "document": "Facebook Privacy Policy", "type": "formatting", "added": 2, "removed": 2, "words_changed": 0, "sections": ["Highlights"], "declared_dates": ["June 26, 2024"], "source_commit": "https://github.com/OpenTermsArchive/pga-versions/commit/f479d791c337c81efb0971fcb3329e25794f115f", "hunks": [{"section": "Highlights", "old_start": 46, "new_start": 46, "lead": "In this policy we list the kinds of information we collect. Here are some important ones. We collect:", "lines": [[" ", "* Information from [partners\\[3\\]](#annotation-3) about things you do both on and off of our Products. This could include other websites you visit, apps you use or online games you play."], [" ", ""], ["-", "[Play Video](https://mbasic.facebook.com/video_redirect/?src=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo-fra3-1.xx.fbcdn.net%2Fv%2Ft42.1790-2%2F281467190_173521038391582_2422662776604828979_n.mp4%3F_nc_cat%3D103%26ccb%3D1-7%26_nc_sid%3D55d0d3%26efg%3DeyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InN2ZV9zZCIsInZpZGVvX2lkIjoxMDc4NDg0MTY5NDE1NzU1fQ%253D%253D%26_nc_ohc%3D1uCOdfnrwbEQ7kNvgEPc4HW%26_nc_ht%3Dvideo-fra3-1.xx%26oh%3D00_AYBfcWJRONFznoPfap9Hlbs_PFaU2IgX7ian17j84e899w%26oe%3D66C7B802&source=misc&id=1078484169415755&noredirect=0&watermark=0&__tn__=F)"], ["+", "[Play Video](https://mbasic.facebook.com/video_redirect/?src=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo-fra3-1.xx.fbcdn.net%2Fv%2Ft42.1790-2%2F281467190_173521038391582_2422662776604828979_n.mp4%3F_nc_cat%3D103%26ccb%3D1-7%26_nc_sid%3D55d0d3%26efg%3DeyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InN2ZV9zZCIsInZpZGVvX2lkIjoxMDc4NDg0MTY5NDE1NzU1fQ%253D%253D%26_nc_ohc%3D1uCOdfnrwbEQ7kNvgEPc4HW%26_nc_ht%3Dvideo-fra3-1.xx%26oh%3D00_AYDYcYZ_-SRrDUz4TUTz4s0Rii3wioMU2EwY0VpCPNWDWg%26oe%3D66C860C2&source=misc&id=1078484169415755&noredirect=0&watermark=0&__tn__=F)"], [" ", ""], [" ", "The information we collect and process abo